<title>USA: Novadigm sees bigger-than-expected Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Novadigm sees bigger-than-expected Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novadigm Inc said total revenues for the 1997 fiscal third quarter ended December 31, 1996 are expected to be significantly below expectations.</p>
<p>The Company said total revenue for the quarter is expected to be about $6 million, pending final reports from Company distributors. With this shortfall in revenues, the company also expects to report a loss significantly greater than expectations.</p>
</text>
